## Encodings

* `ds : List Bool` (lowest digit first), `k = ds.length`, `|I| = Dance.mCount ds`,
  `N = 2 ^ Dance.mCount ds`, `α ≥ 1` (`= e = v_2(q)`), `i : ℕ`; for a family `λ`,
  `ds = Families.ds λ`.
* `Y_2(λ, i, e) = X^{(e)}(λ, i)` is `FamilyGroup.X (Families.ds λ) e i`.
* `S_2(λ)` is `FamilyGroup.SC ds` (its factor `a = 0` is zero, so it is
  `⊕_{h=1}^{k−1} (ℤ/2^h)^{2^{k−h−1+|I|}}`); `C = coker(2^k M)` is `CmodTwo ds α i`.
* `ℤ_[2] ⧸ 2^e` is `FamilyGroup.Q e`; `M ⧸ c M` is `M ⧸ c • ⊤`; isomorphisms are
  `Nonempty (… ≃ₗ[ℤ_[2]] …)`; "generated by `N` elements" is `∃ g : Fin N → C, span (range g) = ⊤`.

